 open the door, that light to you is fire <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Too hot, too hot)</span></text><text for="L48">Black Mamba</text><text for="L1">I'm on the Next Level, yeah</text><text for="L2">Follow the axioms</text><text for="L50">I'm going crazy to find out, what story will follow, huh</text><text for="L3">Don't let go of my hand, unity is my weapon</text><text for="L4">Walk into the wilderness, know your home ground</text><text for="L52">Open the door beyond</text><text for="L5">Face the threat, overcome, overcome, overcome</text><text for="L51">I'm on the Next Level</text><text for="L6">The unimaginable blackout, temptation's deep and dark <span xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">(Too hot, too hot)</span></text><text for="L10">Next Level, I'll break you in the end</text><text for="L54">Next Level, until I reach KOSMO</text><text for="L7">I lose the hand I held, but I can never give up</text><text for="L53">Next Level, I'll break you in the end</text><text for="L8">I'm on the Next Level</text><text for="L12">Next Level, overcome, overcome, overcome</text><text for="L56">I'm on the Next Level</text><text for="L9">Open the door beyond</text><text for="L11">Next Level, until I reach KOSMO</text><text for="L55">Next Level, overcome, overcome, overcome</text><text for="L14">La-la-la-la-la-la</text><text for="L58">Next Level, I've changed since the wilderness</text><text for="L13">La-la-la-la-la-la</text><text for="L57">Become stronger, freely</text><text for="L16">La, la, la, la, la</text><text for="L15">La-la-la-la-la-la</text><text for="L59">Next Level, feel the wild beast in me</text><text for="L18">Hostile hardships and sorrows</text><text for="L17">I see the NU EVO</text><text for="L19">Means more popping, makes me evolve</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>YOO YOUNG JIN</songwriter></songwriters>